  <diagram name="2 Actual Parent Tool Prompt">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1422" dy="794" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1800" pageHeight="1200" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;Parent-visible orch_dispatch prompt data from prompts.yaml / _tool-info&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1000" height="40" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="desc" value="&lt;b&gt;orch_dispatch description contains:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;For non-orchestration work, dispatch a subagent.&#10;The orchestrator session decomposes requests, plans slices,&#10;sequences dispatches, handles user decisions and approvals,&#10;resolves artifact conflicts, manages git boundaries, and&#10;synthesizes compact returned results.&#10;&#10;Inspect the whole request only to identify dispatch slices,&#10;dependencies, blockers, and approval needs. Dispatch one&#10;subagent per slice. Dispatch every currently unblocked&#10;independent slice in parallel before doing anything else.&#10;&#10;Dispatch transfers ownership of the assigned scope to the&#10;subagent. While a subagent owns a scope, the orchestrator&#10;must not read, grep, inspect, edit, debug, test, verify,&#10;review, security-assess, install packages, update dependencies,&#10;create virtualenvs, modify lockfiles, or mutate the tool&#10;environment for that scope.&#10;&#10;Give each subagent a self-contained brief with one goal,&#10;exact scope, boundaries, prior evidence to reuse, artifact&#10;write target, stop condition, and compact return format.&#10;&#10;Completed subagent reports return automatically. Do not poll.&lt;/pre&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="50" y="100" width="760" height="600" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="args" value="&lt;b&gt;Argument descriptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;goal:&#10;One small subagent slice: goal, exact scope, prior evidence&#10;to reuse, stop condition, and return shape.&#10;&#10;additionalContext:&#10;Compact artifact reference for the slice, such as `PLAN.md Slice 2`.&#10;&#10;role:&#10;Optional subagent capability. Choose the enabled role that&#10;best matches the slice.&#10;&#10;taskLabel:&#10;Optional short request label.&lt;/pre&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890" y="100" width="610" height="350" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="status" value="&lt;b&gt;orch_status description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;pre style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Use orch_status only when the user explicitly asks for an&#10;Orchestra status/control/help action in the current session.&#10;Do not poll for completion. Completed subagent reports&#10;return automatically.&lt;/pre&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="890" y="520" width="610" height="160" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
